+            + "534f5331" + String(repeating: "00", count: 64) + "68656c70"))
+        XCTAssertNotNil(f, "well-formed frame must parse at the wire layer")
+        XCTAssertEqual(SosFrameValidator.Verdict.missingRequiredFlags, SosFrameValidator.validate(f!))
+    }
